      "name": "11 - Polling & Lifecycle Flows (Runner)",
      "desc": "## Polling & Lifecycle Flows (Collection Runner)\nComposable flows via `postman.setNextRequest` - run these from the **Collection Runner** (set delay 1000 ms).\n\n- **Flow A:** Generate QR -> poll until settled -> get details -> refund.\n- **Flow B:** Link account -> get token -> charge -> renew -> remove.\n\nFallback: when run as single requests, each step still saves the variables the next step needs (`{{last_tran_id}}`, `{{pwt}}`, `{{request_id}}`).",
